Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses. The bundled OAuth service
uses oidc-provider (MIT); the bundled local engine uses Open Wallet Standard core
(MIT). The default local dispatcher uses the separate official OpenZeppelin Relayer
1.8.0 container image (AGPL-3.0-only) and Valkey 9.1.2 (BSD-3-Clause).
The generated HTTPS profile references the official Caddy container image
(Apache-2.0), operated separately from the Node service. No customer data, production secret or source repository history was imported.
