SingletonPaymaster, eth-infinitism account-abstraction, OpenZeppelin Contracts
and Solady source material. Their source revisions and licenses are recorded in
contracts/vendor/README.md and docs/licenses. Generated paymaster bytecode retains
those upstream licenses.

